<title>DENMARK: Den Danske issues $500 mln private US bond.</title>
<headline>Den Danske issues $500 mln private US bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Den Danske Bank said on Friday it issued a $500 million 13-year U.S. bond as a private placement with institutional investors.</p>
</text>
